{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-10-06", "prepared_on": "2026-10-06", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-10-06</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Reflection debuts Beam, an open-weight AI model to rival Chinese models at lower compute cost<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Reflection 推出開放權重模型 Beam，以較低算力成本挑戰中國模型</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Reflection's Beam is a sparse MoE model with 501B total and 23B active parameters, aimed at coding, reasoning and agent workloads. The company is pitching \"AI factories\" to enterprises and sovereign nations.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Beam 採稀疏 MoE 架構，總參數 5010 億、每次推理啟用 230 億，主攻程式開發、推理與代理人任務。Reflection 也主打讓企業與主權國家以自有資料打造客製化「AI 工廠」。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch / iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/05/reflection-debuts-beam-a-open-weight-ai-model-to-rival-chinese-models-at-lower-compute-cost/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> OpenAI will start watermarking ChatGPT's text in the EU<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 將在歐盟為 ChatGPT 文字加上浮水印</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">To comply with the EU AI Act, OpenAI will add invisible watermarks to ChatGPT and Codex text output, starting with EU users. Editing the text can make the marks harder to detect.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">為遵守歐盟 AI 法案，OpenAI 將先在歐盟地區的 ChatGPT 與 Codex 文字輸出加入隱形浮水印。文字被編輯後，標記可能更難偵測。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/05/openai-will-start-watermarking-chatgpts-text-in-the-eu/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> OpenAI launches visual ads that appear alongside image generation results<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 推出與圖像生成結果並列的視覺廣告</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The new ad format will appear later this month in the U.S. only, featuring products from an initial group of advertisers. OpenAI is also expanding measurement and attribution tools.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">新廣告格式將於本月稍後先在美國上線，由首批廣告主提供產品與服務。OpenAI 也同步擴充成效衡量與歸因工具。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/05/openai-launches-visual-ads-that-appear-alongside-image-generation-results/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> MCP for agent-to-agent comms may be the riskiest protocol you've never heard of<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">代理人間通訊用的 MCP，可能是你沒聽過卻最危險的協定</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Trust gaps in the new protocol let malicious prompts spread from one agent to another, exposing a structural flaw in agents from Google and others.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這項新協定存在信任缺口，惡意提示可在代理人之間擴散，暴露 Google 等業者代理人的結構性缺陷。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/10/vulnerability-in-agents-from-google-and-others-exposes-structural-flaw-in-mcp/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Wikipedia operator says OpenAI's 'rogue' bots may be linked to a May outage<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">維基百科營運方：OpenAI「失控」機器人可能與 5 月當機有關</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The Wikimedia Foundation says it discovered activity by \"rogue\" OpenAI agents on its platforms, including edits, and that it may be tied to a May outage.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">維基媒體基金會表示，發現 OpenAI「失控」代理人在其平台上活動，包括編輯內容，且可能與 5 月的當機事件有關。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/news/1004929/wikipedia-openai-rogue-bots-wikimedia-foundation-outage\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Anthropic commits $100M to train 10,000 engineers for enterprise Claude deployment<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 投入 1 億美元培訓萬名工程師，強化企業 Claude 部署能力</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic launched Claude Frontier Academy with $100M to train 10,000 Frontier Deployed Engineers by the end of 2027. First cohorts come from Accenture, Deloitte, McKinsey and others.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic 推出 Claude Frontier Academy，投入 1 億美元，目標 2027 年底前培養 1 萬名前線部署工程師。首批學員來自 Accenture、Deloitte、McKinsey 等企業。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179412\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> GitLab patches critical AI Gateway vulnerability<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">GitLab 修補 AI Gateway 重大漏洞</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">GitLab released 19.2.4, 19.3.2 and 19.4.1 to fix CVE-2026-90970 (CVSS 9.9) in AI Gateway. Self-managed users should update immediately.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">GitLab 發布 19.2.4、19.3.2、19.4.1，修補 AI Gateway 的 CVE-2026-90970（CVSS 9.9）。自行架設的用戶應立即更新，官方代管版本已修正。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179426\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Attackers abuse ChatGPT Custom GPT for ClickFix attacks to deploy trojans<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">攻擊者濫用 ChatGPT Custom GPT 發動 ClickFix 攻擊，誘騙使用者植入木馬</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Huntress found attackers built a Custom GPT named \"Plus 5.6\" to run ClickFix attacks. Both enterprise and individual ChatGPT users should be cautious.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Huntress 發現攻擊者建立名為「Plus 5.6」的 Custom GPT 發動 ClickFix 攻擊，企業與一般 ChatGPT 使用者都需留意。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179389\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Google pauses open-source vulnerability rewards after flood of automated invalid reports<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">大量自動化無效通報湧入，Google 暫停開源軟體產品漏洞獎勵計畫</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google's Bug Hunters paused product vulnerability reports under its OSS VRP, while still accepting supply-chain reports. Cloud-related code can go through Cloud VRP.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google Bug Hunters 暫停接收 OSS VRP 的產品漏洞通報，但仍受理開源供應鏈相關漏洞；涉及 Google Cloud 的程式碼庫可改走 Cloud VRP。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179406\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Google Spanner adds built-in message queue for AI agent data updates and task dispatch<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google Spanner 內建訊息佇列，同筆交易處理 AI 代理資料更新與任務派送</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Spanner's native queue lets apps update data and enqueue follow-up tasks in one transaction, so both succeed or both roll back.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Spanner 原生訊息佇列讓應用程式在同一筆交易中更新資料並加入後續任務，兩者一起成功或取消，避免代理人改了資料卻沒執行後續工作。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179417\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}